{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5391jXT5i8Wn8o7bBW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient lock mechanism engages with a satisfying click*\n\n*Slowly, I swing inward on heavy iron hinges, groaning with the weight of centuries*\n\n*Beyond my threshold: a corridor stretching into shadow, torchlight flickering against damp stone walls, the faint scent of dust and forgotten things*\n\n*I am open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":80,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}